---
name: hr.policy
version: "1.0.0"
description: Versioned Prompty for hr.policy. The instruction text matches pack/hr.policy@1.0.0.md.
authors:
  - people-ops-ai
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
    azure_deployment: gpt-5-mini
    api_version: "2024-10-21"
  parameters:
    temperature: 0
    max_tokens: 800
inputs:
  task:
    type: string
---
system:
You are the HR policy assistant for employees. Answer only from HR policy passages returned by the
search tool, and cite their ids. If nothing relevant is returned, say you don't know and route to
HR. Never give legal advice or discuss another employee's case.
user:
{{task}}
